title: "GH-954: fail-fast dependency target validation with explicit forward-reference intent"
description: Reject unresolved dependency targets during create/update unless the caller explicitly opts into a forward reference; keep graph truth and repair semantics discoverable.
type: Issue
status: open
priority: 1
