acceptance_criteria: Create and update reject unresolved dependency ids by default; an explicit allow-unresolved contract records intentional forward references; help SDK contracts MCP and completions expose additive replacement removal and forward-reference semantics; structured recovery names search dep-remove replace-deps and clear-deps; tests cover create update bulk and transaction paths
goal: project management = context management
objective: Make dependency writes referentially truthful by default
value: Agents receive immediate recovery instead of silently corrupting the graph
why_now: GitHub #954 demonstrates that the accepted-forward-reference decision in pm-ol5v remains unsafe and combines with strict relationship policy
